sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Dashboard / SDK)
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant Adapter as lighteval Adapter
    participant Sidecar as eval_runtime_sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,MLflow: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Lifecycle

    Client->>KRBAC: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>EvalHub: Forward (mTLS terminated)<br/>X-User, X-Tenant headers
    EvalHub->>EvalHub: TokenReview + SAR check<br/>trustyai.opendatahub.io/evaluations:create<br/>in X-Tenant namespace
    EvalHub->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap + Job<br/>Auth: SA Token<br/>Namespace: tenant
    K8sAPI-->>EvalHub: Job created
    EvalHub-->>KRBAC: 201 Created (Job ID)
    KRBAC-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over S3,Adapter: Init Container Phase
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        K8sAPI->>S3: eval_runtime_init downloads test data<br/>Auth: AWS Credentials (secret files)
        S3-->>K8sAPI: Data to /test_data volume
    end

    Note over Adapter,MLflow: Evaluation Execution Phase
    rect rgb(245, 245, 220)
        Adapter->>Sidecar: Evaluation results<br/>HTTP localhost:8080
        Sidecar->>EvalHub: POST /api/v1/.../events<br/>HTTPS, Bearer Token, Custom CA
        EvalHub-->>Sidecar: Acknowledged
        Sidecar->>MLflow: Log metrics & artifacts<br/>HTTPS, Bearer Token (cached)
        MLflow-->>Sidecar: Acknowledged
    end

    Note over Client,MLflow: Flow 2: Prometheus Metrics Scrape

    participant Prom as Prometheus
    Prom->>EvalHub: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8080/TCP
    EvalHub-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
